docs {
  # Admin
  
  Session-authenticated admin / Inertia routes (not Public API Bearer).
  
  ## Subfolders
  
  | Folder | Purpose |
  |--------|---------|
  | *(root)* | Collection / field packs |
  | **Settings/** | Project settings sections + webhook/notifier tests (core 1.3.0 / #201) |
  
  ## Auth
  
  1. Sign in at `{{base_url}}`
  2. Copy session cookie into `Cookie:` on the request
  3. Mutating calls need CSRF (`X-XSRF-TOKEN` from `XSRF-TOKEN` cookie)
  
  Pack routes need `can-create-collections` / `can-edit-collections`. Settings need `CanManageProjectSettings`.
}
